WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.830 --> 00:00:02.260
Can you see the gut?

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:03.800
Is it hiding the gut?

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.100
Do I have breasts?

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.700
We need you to make comedy
because life f****** sucks

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:13.450
right now.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:14.950
I'm going to teach
you about comedy.

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:18.240
How to make it, how to direct
it, how to write it, how to

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.200
perform it.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.860
Oh my god, sports?

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:22.500
I love them.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:23.720
Who are your favorite teams?

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:26.610
The Orlando ... Blooms?

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:28.910
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:34.090
People should look at comedies
as dramas when they're writing.

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:36.130
They should be stories
that would work just as

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:37.440
well without any jokes.

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:39.990
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:42.250
When they're all improvising,
I'll yell out things.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:46.085
It's almost like I'm a
third actor in the scene.

00:00:46.085 --> 00:00:47.130
Oh, that feels warm.

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:48.310
OK, this is going to
hurt a little bit.

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:48.880
That's OK.

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:50.377
[SCREAMING]

00:00:50.377 --> 00:00:51.375
Stop smiling.

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:55.930
Ask yourself a lot of questions,

00:00:55.930 --> 00:01:00.320
because usually that's where the
humor is, is in your identity.

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:02.800
The more nervous I get,
the more I smile so--

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:04.629
Stop smiling.

00:01:04.629 --> 00:01:05.379
Stop it.

00:01:05.379 --> 00:01:07.900
You know, you're using
those real-life moments

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:11.135
as ingredients that are
inspired by things that

00:01:11.135 --> 00:01:13.150
have happened in your life.

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:14.360
I am you.

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:16.780
And you are me.

00:01:16.780 --> 00:01:19.390
And we are making
love to your wife.

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:20.860
And she is us.

00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:25.074
And we, we're making
love, you and me.

00:01:25.074 --> 00:01:27.410
OK.

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:29.530
People who get
involved in comedy

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:31.150
are upset about something.

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:32.920
I think I spent a
lot of my childhood

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:35.900
alone because people
were playing sports.

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:38.110
I was picked last in gym class.

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:40.231
And it made me angry.

00:01:40.231 --> 00:01:41.230
You know what is comedy?

00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:44.470
It's speaking your truth
and revealing your darkest,

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:47.650
deepest stuff that for most
people they would keep hidden.

00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:50.320
Stories are about
people who are messed up

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:53.780
and need to figure
out a way to grow.

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:55.220
So you want f***** up people.

00:01:55.220 --> 00:01:57.790
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:57.790 --> 00:02:01.270
Find the courage to tell
a heartfelt, great story

00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:05.180
to show how people try to grow,
how they try to find happiness.

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:08.139
And every once in a while,
they pee with a boner.

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:15.470
I'm Judd Apatow, and
this is my MasterClass.

